    e "But it's just easier to get there from hers!"

    n "I grinned at her, teasing."

    a "I bet it is. Are you two dating yet?"

    e "No, it's not official... she said wanted to work on herself a bit before getting into any serious relationships. But it's so much fun to see her."

    a "Well, I hope you enjoy yourself over there! Love ya girl, have a good night."

    e "Love ya toooo, night night!"

